  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-14:/asia/business-strategy/593491</id>
    <title type="text">Demographic changes to shrink Canada's workforce: Bank of Canada</title>
    <updated>2026-10-14T14:55:56Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/business-strategy/demographic-changes-to-shrink-canadas-workforce-bank-of-canada-593491.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;‘Businesses need to understand it to develop new markets and products, invest in productivity-enhancing technology and help their workers gain skills for the future’&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/036/0363_639274915805105444.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-14:/asia/news/breaking-news/593437</id>
    <title type="text">Credit cover alone will not scale emerging-market climate finance, Moody’s says</title>
    <updated>2026-10-14T03:12:28Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/breaking-news/credit-cover-alone-will-not-scale-emergingmarket-climate-finance-moodys-says-593437.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Insurance and guarantees made up 14% of concessional support, but projects still have to be able to pay their own way&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/023/0382_639275522795184336.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-14:/asia/news/life-insurance/593434</id>
    <title type="text">Manulife launches enterprise AI platform as it targets $1 billion in value by 2027</title>
    <updated>2026-10-14T03:08:20Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/life-insurance/manulife-launches-enterprise-ai-platform-as-it-targets-1-billion-in-value-by-2027-593434.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Approved AI tools can be reused across markets, starting with a US quoting tool that speeds preliminary life underwriting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/023/0382_639275517640277811.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-14:/asia/news/breaking-news/593358</id>
    <title type="text">Indonesia's draft capital rules would restrict smaller insurers' credit and specialty lines</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T19:07:49Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/breaking-news/indonesias-draft-capital-rules-would-restrict-smaller-insurers-credit-and-specialty-lines-593358.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;70% of Fitch-rated insurers fall short of 2028 equity targets, and lower-capital insurers could lose credit lines and face retention caps on hull, aviation and energy&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0321_639275152577840150.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-14:/asia/news/cyber/593357</id>
    <title type="text">Gallagher adds cyber risk advisory to its Middle East offer as regional rates fall</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T19:03:53Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/cyber/gallagher-adds-cyber-risk-advisory-to-its-middle-east-offer-as-regional-rates-fall-593357.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;A new practice led by actuary Sidharth Wahi turns technical vulnerabilities into financial loss estimates, while Middle East cyber rates fall 5% to 10%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0321_639275150140313317.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-14:/asia/news/diversity-inclusion/593355</id>
    <title type="text">Final opportunity to recognise exceptional women in insurance</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T19:00:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/diversity-inclusion/final-opportunity-to-recognise-exceptional-women-in-insurance-593355.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Last chance to nominate an Elite Woman for the 2027&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0321_639275147622104555.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-14:/asia/news/breaking-news/593354</id>
    <title type="text">Lloyd’s Asia joins GAIP as just 8% of Asia’s disaster losses were insured last year</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T18:56:43Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/breaking-news/lloyds-asia-joins-gaip-as-just-8-of-asias-disaster-losses-were-insured-last-year-593354.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The Lloyd’s market’s largest hub outside London will feed underwriting input into research on product suitability and distribution&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0321_639275145798113684.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-13:/asia/news/breaking-news/593255</id>
    <title type="text">Chipmaker assets have tripled in a decade, and declared values may not have kept up</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T03:02:34Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/breaking-news/chipmaker-assets-have-tripled-in-a-decade-and-declared-values-may-not-have-kept-up-593255.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Atrium says $529bn of plant and stock at the top 20 makers puts reporting clauses and contingent BI under pressure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/003/0382_639274642195350094.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-13:/asia/news/breaking-news/593240</id>
    <title type="text">Former Chubb ANZ chief sues insurer, Asia-Pacific boss and directors</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T03:01:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/breaking-news/former-chubb-anz-chief-sues-insurer-asiapacific-boss-and-directors-593240.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Ben Howell, a former Singapore-based regional executive who later ran Chubb's Australia and New Zealand business, has named regional president Marcos Gunn among 11 individual respondents in a Fair Work claim.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/026/0311_639274571230733739.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-13:/asia/news/life-insurance/593252</id>
    <title type="text">Japan orders Prudential’s life units to stop soliciting new business until January 31</title>
    <updated>2026-10-13T02:58:40Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/life-insurance/japan-orders-prudentials-life-units-to-stop-soliciting-new-business-until-january-31-593252.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The FSA froze new business at Prudential of Japan and across Gibraltar Life’s employed sales force but spared its independent agencies&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/003/0382_639274638741304384.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-13:/asia/news/life-insurance/593200</id>
    <title type="text">APAC medical cost growth to slow significantly in 2027</title>
    <updated>2026-10-12T18:42:41Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/life-insurance/apac-medical-cost-growth-to-slow-significantly-in-2027-593200.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Slower growth may ease healthcare budgeting pressures but will not necessarily translate into smaller insurance premium increases&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0343_639274273549340810.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-13:/asia/news/travel/593199</id>
    <title type="text">Same premium, smaller cover: the age cuts hidden in travel plans</title>
    <updated>2026-10-12T18:38:46Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/travel/same-premium-smaller-cover-the-age-cuts-hidden-in-travel-plans-593199.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Keeping full benefits for older travellers cost 27% to 36% more in a Hong Kong study, while Policybazaar says some plans tighten sub-limits from 50&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0343_639274271214170340.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-13:/asia/news/technology/593176</id>
    <title type="text">Data centre losses could cross policies and portfolios, Asia-Pacific insurers warn</title>
    <updated>2026-10-12T16:57:19Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/technology/data-centre-losses-could-cross-policies-and-portfolios-asiapacific-insurers-warn-593176.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Shared power, contractors and networks make it harder to trace a loss, complicating BI cover and accumulation modelling&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0343_639274210197957677.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-12:/asia/news/cyber/593136</id>
    <title type="text">H&amp;M investigates hacking claims as retail cyber risks spread</title>
    <updated>2026-10-12T14:10:03Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/cyber/handm-investigates-hacking-claims-as-retail-cyber-risks-spread-593136.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The cyber scare follows ASOS breach as hackers exploit third-party access&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/003/0343_639274109962502168.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-10:/asia/news/life-insurance/593043</id>
    <title type="text">Singapore's CI definitions are moving toward disease. Legacy policies aren't</title>
    <updated>2026-10-09T18:13:09Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/life-insurance/singapores-ci-definitions-are-moving-toward-disease--legacy-policies-arent-593043.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The LIA will look at disease-severity definitions in its 2027 review. That does not help anyone holding a policy written under 2019 or earlier wording - and that conversation is on the adviser&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0321_639271663844226958.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-10:/asia/news/catastrophe/593034</id>
    <title type="text">Thailand’s new disaster insurance scheme caps household payouts at 100,000 baht</title>
    <updated>2026-10-09T16:06:49Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/catastrophe/thailands-new-disaster-insurance-scheme-caps-household-payouts-at-100000-baht-593034.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The government-funded programme covers 30 million homes but excludes contents and moveable property, leaving room for private cover&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639271586894267761.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-09:/asia/news/life-insurance/593011</id>
    <title type="text">Insurance moves: Manulife, Prudential</title>
    <updated>2026-10-09T14:13:22Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/life-insurance/insurance-moves-manulife-prudential-593011.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Manulife promotes its Hong Kong technology chief to lead Asia, as Prudential Singapore fills partnership distribution and strategy roles&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639271519242622981.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-09:/asia/news/technology/592870</id>
    <title type="text">Singapore’s AI governance rules: what brokers and insurers must know before 2027</title>
    <updated>2026-10-08T17:14:35Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/technology/singapores-ai-governance-rules-what-brokers-and-insurers-must-know-before-2027-592870.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Insurers and intermediaries must govern their own AI use, including TP tools, with compliance phased in from October 2027&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639270764008843873.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-09:/asia/news/auto-motor/592867</id>
    <title type="text">Hong Kong insurers must pay first when cross-border drivers use unapproved driver-assist systems</title>
    <updated>2026-10-08T16:39:43Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/auto-motor/hong-kong-insurers-must-pay-first-when-crossborder-drivers-use-unapproved-driverassist-systems-592867.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Recovery from mainland policyholders is the open question as the Southbound scheme expands and unapproved ADAS use goes unchecked&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639270742929722889.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-08:/asia/news/cyber/592835</id>
    <title type="text">Suspected AI-enabled hacks on Korean banks test cyber limits for financial institutions</title>
    <updated>2026-10-08T14:45:03Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/cyber/suspected-aienabled-hacks-on-korean-banks-test-cyber-limits-for-financial-institutions-592835.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Incidents impacting seven financial institutions exposed tens of thousands of customer records, putting breach response costs and limit adequacy in focus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639270674361491060.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-08:/asia/news/mergers-acquisitions/592814</id>
    <title type="text">Dealmakers are moving faster and bigger, yet underperforming, WTW says</title>
    <updated>2026-10-08T10:24:31Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/mergers-acquisitions/dealmakers-are-moving-faster-and-bigger-yet-underperforming-wtw-says-592814.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Nine mega deals closed in Q3 alone, yet acquirers trailed the market index across almost every major region&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/003/0359_639270518376676153.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-08:/asia/news/claims/592799</id>
    <title type="text">Average business interruption claim now 70% larger than property damage, Allianz finds</title>
    <updated>2026-10-08T08:16:10Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/claims/average-business-interruption-claim-now-70-larger-than-property-damage-allianz-finds-592799.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Allianz Commercial data shows BI claim severity rising more than 30% annually, with fire and supply chains driving losses&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/003/0359_639270441022250528.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-08:/asia/news/breaking-news/592727</id>
    <title type="text">Multiple fatalities reported as drones, missiles hit Saudi international airports</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T22:38:40Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/breaking-news/multiple-fatalities-reported-as-drones-missiles-hit-saudi-international-airports-592727.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Insurers, airlines on alert after sharp escalation in civilian risk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/003/0311_639270095171861382.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-07:/asia/news/life-insurance/592689</id>
    <title type="text">The fraud window in South Korea’s NHIS opens the moment a foreign worker leaves</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T15:47:11Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/life-insurance/the-fraud-window-in-south-koreas-nhis-opens-the-moment-a-foreign-worker-leaves-592689.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Lawmakers want real-time eligibility controls as credential sharing and unpaid premiums add pressure to the NHIS&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639269846896010947.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-07:/asia/business-strategy/592681</id>
    <title type="text">Air quality blamed for dipping productivity at end of workdays</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T15:39:01Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/business-strategy/air-quality-blamed-for-dipping-productivity-at-end-of-workdays-592681.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;CO2 is in the air and it's behind the post-3pm slump&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/035/0365_639268567419321370.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-07:/asia/news/catastrophe/592676</id>
    <title type="text">Philippines nears sovereign disaster risk deal as domestic catastrophe pool struggles for traction</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T15:12:53Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/catastrophe/philippines-nears-sovereign-disaster-risk-deal-as-domestic-catastrophe-pool-struggles-for-traction-592676.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The sovereign parametric deal covers government exposures only, and the domestic pool covers earthquake alone, leaving typhoon and flood placements reliant on offshore capacity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639269826835272753.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-07:/asia/news/sme/592667</id>
    <title type="text">South Korea’s free SME cover: what the limits leave exposed</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T14:18:26Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/sme/south-koreas-free-sme-cover-what-the-limits-leave-exposed-592667.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Government baseline cover caps property at KRW 50 million and excludes business interruption, creating clear space for broker-placed commercial lines&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/024/0381_639269793637799060.jpg" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-07:/asia/news/cyber/592583</id>
    <title type="text">CFC adds executive protection, AI cover to cyber policy</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T01:50:49Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/cyber/cfc-adds-executive-protection-ai-cover-to-cyber-policy-592583.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Cyber Proactive Response update also stretches the business interruption indemnity period to 18 months&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/018/0382_639269413882521552.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-07:/asia/news/breaking-news/592641</id>
    <title type="text">Cyber is now the risk most likely to trigger everything else: Hiscox</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T01:45:13Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/breaking-news/cyber-is-now-the-risk-most-likely-to-trigger-everything-else-hiscox-592641.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;More than half of risk managers identified cyber threats and AI-enabled fraud as their strongest interconnected risk pairing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/018/0000_639269408999548040.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:insurancebusinessmag.com,2026-10-07:/asia/news/professional-liability/592443</id>
    <title type="text">HDI Global expands medical malpractice into global healthcare unit</title>
    <updated>2026-10-07T00:06:17Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.insurancebusinessmag.com/asia/news/professional-liability/hdi-global-expands-medical-malpractice-into-global-healthcare-unit-592443.aspx" />
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;New unit targets healthcare providers, allied health, and long-term care as capacity tightens&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-res.keymedia.com/cms/images/us/003/0359_639268741684875230.png" alt="" style="max-width:240px" /&gt;</content>
  </entry>
</feed>